# This workspace is a shared drawer: dozens of unrelated experiments, browser
# profiles, logs and screenshots live here. The repository tracks ONLY the
# Defiende el Trono automation, so everything is ignored by default and the
# relevant trees are re-included explicitly.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/**
!/scripts/
!/scripts/lib/
!/scripts/lib/**
!/scripts/trono/
!/scripts/trono/**
!/docs/
!/docs/trono/
!/docs/trono/**

# Volatile or regenerable artifacts inside the tracked tree
scripts/trono/logs/
scripts/trono/state/
# The seed of measured fight costs is NOT volatile: without it a cold cache
# demotes every target (pool 330 requires sim cost <= 27 HP) and the agent
# idles forever. Only this file is versioned; the live copy stays in the cache.
!scripts/trono/state/
scripts/trono/state/*
!scripts/trono/state/learning.seed.json
**/player_state_raw*.json
**/driver.lock
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Never version secrets or credential material
**/credentials.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
